      description:
        "Plots Larry Williams' cumulative accumulation/distribution line in its original price-only form: each bar adds the close's progress from the true low on up-closes and subtracts its distance from the true high on down-closes, with an optional volume-weighted variant. A 20-period EMA smoothing, directional coloring and automatic divergence detection complete the build.",
